      "id": 110493,
      "name": "Foote",
      "username": "Foote",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-07-29T12:57:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Gaurdians 2 was a surprise. It seems they are starting to count their chickens before they hatch, though early reviews say the first one will be pretty awesome. And the Avengers series of movies have been getting better with each release (well, Ironman 3 was kinda \"meh\" for me). I need more Hulk though, which brings me to my next point.</p><p>Hulk vs Hulkbuster will be in Age of Ultron. Yeah, I squeeled like a school girl upon seeing the leaked still. You gotta understand, I LOVE the Hulk, just as much as I love Wolverine and Bats. I would scream in the ear of the cutest kitten I could find for a Wolrd War Hulk movie.&nbsp;</p><p>I was disapointed in the lack of Mass Effect news. They have me chomping on the bit for even a smidgen of something substancial. Seriously, I don't give a Plauge-Rats arse about the Mako, give me something we can start digging into.</p><p>Other than that I didn't follow much other news.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:41:29.082Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 10810,
      "topic_slug": "comic-con-news",
      "display_username": "Foote",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
      "flair_color": "",
      "flair_group_id": 41,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 1,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Gaurdians 2 was a surprise. It seems they are starting to count their chickens before they hatch, though early reviews say the first one will be pretty awesome. And the Avengers series of movies have been getting better with each release (well, Ironman 3 was kinda &quot;meh&quot; for me). I need more Hulk though, which brings me to my next point.</p><p>Hulk vs Hulkbuster will be in Age of Ultron. Yeah, I squeeled like a school girl upon seeing the leaked still. You gotta understand, I LOVE the Hulk, just as much as I love Wolverine and Bats. I would scream in the ear of the cutest kitten I could find for a Wolrd War Hulk movie.&nbsp;</p><p>I was disapointed in the lack of Mass Effect news. They have me chomping on the bit for even a smidgen of something substancial. Seriously, I don&#39;t give a Plauge-Rats arse about the Mako, give me something we can start digging into.</p><p>Other than that I didn&#39;t follow much other news.</p>",
